{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI於周五宣佈，已對用於訓練和評估前沿模型的研究環境實施更嚴格的安全管控，核心政策是：<strong>前沿模型在訓練期間不得直接訪問實時互聯網</strong>。該公司表示，這一政策將維持到相關安全防護技術取得足夠進展為止。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583624.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T21:23:58.080432+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:59:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T21:18:05.721014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T21:18:05.721014+00:00","content_hash":"495676848f34a16edea970eca3f44d70bac4a51ccd457226c54d2eee8b05cdf1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}